0021E NOM0021E Error :1: occurred.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#TEXT:
#  A Natural Runtime error has occurred.
#EXPL:
#  The error message format is as follows:
#  PPPPPPPP/VVVV/CCCCCC/LLLL/NNNN ... (additional text)
#  where:
#  PPPPPPPP = Program name
#  VVVV     = NOM version, release, service pack, cumulated fix
#  CCCCCC   = Catalog date, format: YYMMDD
#  LLLL     = Line number
#  NNNN     = Error number
#  
#  The error message will be extended by Adabas fields if an Adabas
#  error was detected.
#ACTN:
#  Check for a permanent error condition. Contact Software AG support.
0022E NOM0022 User-id must start with a letter (A-Z) or a number (0-9).
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#TEXT:
#EXPL:
#ACTN:
