0133E NOM0133E Wrong buffer for compression detected in line :1:.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#TEXT:
#  NOM detected a buffer which cannot be compressed or decompressed.
#EXPL:
#  The compression routine nomcompr can process buffer sizes of about
#  16kB length. If an unknown version or a corrupted buffer is deteced
#  this error will be issued.
#  The error will occur especially if a lower NOM version tries to
#  process a buffer which was written by a higher NOM version.
#  The line number is the program line in error.
#ACTN:
#  Check for correct NOM version and contact Software AG support personnel.
