2142E NOM2142 Unix command :1: missing. No conversion possible.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#TEXT:
#  A utility is missing on an open systems machine such like ghostscript
#  or enscript
#EXPL:
#  NOM requires two utilities to do conversion to specific file formats:
#  'enscript' is used to convert text data to postscript
#  'ghostscript' is used to convert postscript or PDF to other formats.
#  Both utilities have to be present in the directory path of the machines
#  that do the conversion. This can be the machine where reports are read
#  from or the machine where a DISKUNIX printer outputs the file to.
#  
#  Downloads: 'http://sourceforge.net/projects/ghostscript/' and
#             'http://www.gnu.org/software/enscript/'
#ACTN:
#  Install the 'ghostscript' and 'enscript' utilties on all source and
#  destination machines (NPR nodes) and put them into the current path.
